  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Financial Reporting Framework and Audit Practice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed IDF is to build capacity  of   ICAB by  enhancing    professional education standards in Bangladesh, strengthening the monitoring capacity of its quality assurance department with a view to contributing to improved compliance with financial reporting and auditing standards by practicing firms and to enabling the government to update the financial reporting framework for high quality financial reporting and audit in public sector entities.  The overall objective of the proposed IDF is to support MoF and ICAB in strengthening the existing  financial reporting framework of public enterprises and improve the capacity of ICAB to educate, train, and regulate the accounting Profession in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
